| Woods | 4.65% | 5.07% | 11.55% | 12.55% | 24.99% | 24.50% |
| Musk / ambrette | 0.57% | 0.93% | 1.90% | 3.11% | 10.24% | 15.53% |
| Pear / fruit | 1.12% | 2.95% | 0.18% | 0.83% | 0.02% | 0.15% |
| Sweet / powder | 2.01% | 1.83% | 5.15% | 4.70% | 13.20% | 11.17% |
| Leather | 1.66% | 1.47% | 4.06% | 3.62% | 8.27% | 6.85% |
| Cocoa / depth | 0.00% | 0.39% | 0.00% | 0.36% | 0.00% | 0.41% |

### Interpretation

- Iris/orris remains the clear heart and drydown identity.
- Pear/fruit opening visibility rises by roughly 2.6×.
- Musk/ambrette drydown visibility rises from about 10.2% to 15.5%.
- Woods gain precision in the heart without becoming the main story.
- The relative sweet/powder share falls because the new additions add structure rather than more vanilla or coumarin.
- Cocoa remains a shadow rather than a chocolate note.

## Mixing order

1. Preblend Romandolide, Ambrettolide 10%, Exaltolide 10%, Orris Liquid and Alpha Irone 30%.
2. Add Violet Leaf 10%, Ultralia, Vetival, Cedarwood Virginia, Iso E Super and Hedione.
3. Add Apritone 10%, Allyl Cyclohexyl Propionate 10%, Hexyl Acetate 10%, Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate 0.1%, Cocoa CO2, Damascenone 1%, Beta Damascone 10%, Lavender High Altitude and Cedrat.
4. Mix Wave 2 thoroughly, then add it to the existing bottle.
5. Add the Habanolide restoration separately if it is still missing.
6. Mix gently but completely. Rest at least 72 hours before the first serious judgment and 7–14 days before the final decision.

## Stop condition

Do not create a Wave 3 before evaluation. If this larger, registration-gated module still produces no perceptible change after proper rest, the likely problem is the underlying hybrid base or an inaccurate bottle ledger. At that point, rebuild from a clean formula rather than stacking more traces.

## Safety boundary

This is a research correction, not a current IFRA Category 4 certificate. The existing base contains IBQ, Eugenol, Cinnamal-related materials, naturals and other restricted or sensitizing components. Do not interpret higher concentration as automatic skin-use clearance.
